# Files Vercel must NOT deploy as public static assets.
# The repo root holds the real master workbooks (10+ MB of business data)
# and desktop-client/ holds the Electron app — including its renderer
# fallback stub, which fabricates a signed-in admin with no login.
# None of that may be reachable from the deployed site.
# NOTE: the materials index chunks live under api/materials-data/ on
# purpose (see api/materials.js). Files under api/ are bundled into the
# function and are NOT served as public static files, so no .vercelignore
# line is needed for them. Do NOT move the chunks to data/ — data/ is
# ignored here, and Vercel then never bundles them: live /api/materials
# 500s with "ENOENT: scandir '/var/task/data'" (seen 2026-11-11).
desktop-client
